---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { publications } from "../data/publications";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---
<BaseLayout title="屏幕之外">
<section class="inner-heading">
<div>
<span class="eyebrow">OUTSIDE THE TERMINAL</span>
<h1>做工具的人，<br>也在练习<span class="ink-word">生活。</span>
</h1>
<p>Kenny Wu · AI engineer · Shenzhen。工作在语言系统、多模态流程与本地优先工具之间。</p>
</div>
<img src="/assets/img/practices/listen.png" alt="Kenny 的听音乐插画" width="1254" height="1254">
</section>
<section class="section about-questions">
<span class="eyebrow">QUESTIONS I KEEP COMING BACK TO</span>
<h2>反复回到的三个问题</h2>
<a href="/notes/?topic=memory">
<span>01</span>什么值得成为长期上下文？<span>→</span>
</a>
<a href="/projects/#tracework">
<span>02</span>Agent 怎样解释决定，又不制造噪声？<span>→</span>
</a>
<a href="/projects/#card-skill">
<span>03</span>什么约束能让模型产出可靠作品？<span>→</span>
</a>
</section>
<section class="section">
<span class="eyebrow">SMALL PRACTICES</span>
<h2 class="inner-section-title">屏幕以外，注意力还有别的去处。</h2>
<div class="practice-shelf">
<details class="practice-card">
<summary>
<img src="/assets/img/practices/listen.png" alt="Listen · 听的 Kenny 插画" width="1254" height="1254">
<span>Listen · 听 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
</span>
</summary>
<p>给不同的节奏留一点位置。</p>
</details>
<details class="practice-card">
<summary>
<img src="/assets/img/practices/read.png" alt="Read · 读的 Kenny 插画" width="1254" height="1254">
<span>Read · 读 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
</span>
</summary>
<p>沿着一个想法，回到它的来源。</p>
</details>
<details class="practice-card">
<summary>
<img src="/assets/img/practices/walk.png" alt="Walk · 走的 Kenny 插画" width="1254" height="1254">
<span>Walk · 走 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
</span>
</summary>
<p>让问题在走动中慢慢松开。</p>
</details>
<details class="practice-card">
<summary>
<img src="/assets/img/practices/return.png" alt="Return · 回来的 Kenny 插画" width="1254" height="1254">
<span>Return · 回来 <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
</span>
</summary>
<p>回到力量、平衡与呼吸。</p>
</details>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section">
<span class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORK</span>
<h2 class="inner-section-title">从研究，走到真实系统。</h2>
<div class="work-list">
<details open>
<summary>
<span class="note-date">2026 · Lead</span>
<span>AI 漫画生成</span>
<span class="expand">＋</span>
</summary>
<p>分阶段的 LLM 工作流：叙事切分、场景分析、镜头生成，以及可复用的角色和场景记忆。</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>
<span class="note-date">2025–2026</span>
<span>短剧身份一致性系统</span>
<span class="expand">＋</span>
</summary>
<p>负责方向：跨集实体对齐、检索、调度与缓存复用，让生成剪辑保持连续。</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>
<span class="note-date">2024</span>
<span>企业 RAG 与安全审核</span>
<span class="expand">＋</span>
</summary>
<p>核心算法工程：分层切片、多阶段检索、动态阈值与提示词辅助的内部安全审核。</p>
</details>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section research-section">
<span class="eyebrow">RESEARCH</span>
<h2 class="inner-section-title">更早的一些追问。</h2>{publications.main.map(pub=>
<a class="note-link" href={pub.pdf} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
<span>{pub.conference_short}</span>
<strong>{pub.title} ↗</strong>
<span set:html={pub.authors} />
</a>)}</section>
<aside class="next-room">
<div>
<span>关于合作、上下文难题，或一个不同的看法</span>
<p>欢迎来交换想法。</p>
</div>
<div class="detail-links">
<a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>写封信给我 ↗</a>
<a href={site.cv_link}>查看履历 ↗</a>
</div>
</aside>
</BaseLayout>
